Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:14.63,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quero sair correndo pela multidão movimentada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:20.59,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}As pessoas enchem as ruas de novo, como se tivessem sido chamadas aqui
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:25.47,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Ver todo mundo dizendo "Volte sempre!" me deixa tão orgulhosa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:31.93,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Com as expectativas crescendo, fico super empolgada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:35.06,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Me mantenho bem ereta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:37.57,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Desculpa, te fiz esperar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:41.78,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quando vejo esses sorrisos passando, eu quero abraçar essas pessoas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:42.90,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Bem apertado
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:48.87,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Entrem, pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:51.58,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}O começo sempre chega,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.58,0:01:56.58,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}E, antes que você perceba, eu já estou correndo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:59.75,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}É quase como se toda festa estivesse acontecendo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:02.63,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Em um brilho deslumbrante
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:05.80,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Esse lugar não é tão brilhante?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:10.22,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Entrem e deem uma olhada!
