Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:59.08,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Girando, girando, um disco
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:02.58,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Se a agulha pular no sulco
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:07.50,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}As notas vão ficar um pouco falhas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.13,0:22:14.80,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Se eu não conseguir consertar com o meu secador, vou ficar em apuros
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:21.23,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Conversamos demais ontem à noite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:29.53,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Quando tentei tirar minhas lentes de contato,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.11,0:22:34.78,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}O mundo ficou todo embaçado
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:43.71,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Demorei um segundo pra olhar ao redor e ver onde eu estava
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:51.72,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Será que tudo isso vai me deixar um dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:57.60,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}As coisas que procuramos
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:23:01.22,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Estão sempre escondidas bem ao nosso lado
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:07.15,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Mesmo se você não consegue ver e tem que procurá-las sentindo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:11.78,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Ah, girando, girando, um disco
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:15.32,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}A agulha pula no sulco
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:20.66,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Mas escute isso, que melodia curiosa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:24.33,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Tenho certeza de que nunca vou esquecer
